1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:03,200
And how was your timetable?
你的课程安排怎么样？

2
00:00:03,210 --> 00:00:04,820
Was it a very busy year?
是很忙碌的一年吗？

3
00:00:04,830 --> 00:00:09,150
Very,very busy.They make you work very hard.
非常忙碌，他们要让你非常努力的学习。

4
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:14,000
Apart from lectures,we had practical sessions in a lot of subjects.
除了讲座，我们的很多科目都有实习课。

5
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,710
We did these in small groups.
我们在小组里完成这些。

6
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:20,810
I had to go and work four hours every week in a community pharmacy.
我不得不每周在社区药房工作4小时。

7
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:26,070
Actually,I enjoyed this very much - meeting new people all the time.
事实上我很享受这一切，总是能遇见新的人。

8
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:31,000
Then in second semester,we had to get experience in hospital dispensaries,
之后在第二学期，我们就去了医院的药房实习，

9
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:36,100
so every second day we went to one of the big hospitals and worked there.
所以每两天我们就去其中一家大医院并在那里工作。

10
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:41,050
And on top of all that we had our assignments,which took me a lot of time.
而且最重要的是我们还有作业，这花了我很多时间。

11
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:48,160
Oh,I nearly forgot,between first and second semesters,we had to work full-time for two weeks in a hospital.
我差点忘了，在第一和第二学期之间，我们不得不在医院全职工作两周。

12
00:00:48,170 --> 00:00:50,300
That does sound a very heavy year.
听起来是任务很重的一年。

13
00:00:50,310 --> 00:00:52,810
So are you pleased now that you did it?
那么你喜欢你的工作吗？

14
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:55,040
Do you feel some sense of achievement?
你感到有成就感吗？

15
00:00:55,050 --> 00:01:00,750
Yeah,I do feel much more confident,which I suppose is the most important thing.
是的，我确实感到更有自信了，我想这也是最重要的。

16
00:01:00,760 --> 00:01:05,030
And have you got any recommendations for people who are studying from overseas?
你对海外求学的学生有什么建议吗？

17
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:08,160
Well,I suppose they need very good English.
我想他们需要英语很好。

18
00:01:08,170 --> 00:01:13,420
It would be much better if they spent more time learning English before they enter the university,
最好是他们能在入学前多花时间学好英语，。

19
00:01:13,430 --> 00:01:20,030
because you can be in big trouble if you don't understand what people are saying and you haven't got time to translate.
因为如果你听不懂人们说话又没时间翻译的话，你会陷入大麻烦

20
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:29,490
Anything else? Well,as I said before,the biggert problem for me was a lack of familiarity with the education system here.
还有吗？正如我之前说的，对于我来说，最大的问题是缺乏对这里教育体系的认知。

21
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:35,250
It sounds as if it was a real challenge.Congratulations,Kira. Thanks,Paul.
这听起来像是一个真正的挑战。祝贺你，基拉。-谢谢，保罗。
